        "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Quick reflexes. Simple controls. Instant retries!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Neon Strike is a fast-paced action-puzzler where you dash, bounce, and swap colors for survival. Get the color right, you're safe. Get it wrong... instant retry!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3685030/extras/8f7673ca8f2018528ecee6613d5b99f4.poster.avif?t=1763581814\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3685030/extras/8f7673ca8f2018528ecee6613d5b99f4.webm?t=1763581814\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3685030/extras/8f7673ca8f2018528ecee6613d5b99f4.mp4?t=1763581814\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Controls are super simple: one button to move, one to switch colors. Play with one hand on keyboard, mouse, or controller.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You start as a sphere with one color and can absorb more by colliding with other spheres. But you can only store two colors at a time. Grab a third, and the oldest one gets replaced.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To pass anything that isn’t a sphere, your active color must match. Get it wrong and you’ll explode. Watch out for other traps too!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>There’s more than one way to play:</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Tactical Mode</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get to the goal! Bounce, stick, and aim your way through grid-based puzzles using smart angles and color swaps.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3685030/extras/2804ae427aa37b1f0ac02770d88a93bd.poster.avif?t=1763581814\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3685030/extras/2804ae427aa37b1f0ac02770d88a93bd.webm?t=1763581814\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3685030/extras/2804ae427aa37b1f0ac02770d88a93bd.mp4?t=1763581814\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Infinite Mode</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survive as long as you can. Things only get faster, meaner, and more chaotic.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3685030/extras/32833988b5375d3dbc4d4a7fa4af5b3c.poster.avif?t=1763581814\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3685030/extras/32833988b5375d3dbc4d4a7fa4af5b3c.webm?t=1763581814\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3685030/extras/32833988b5375d3dbc4d4a7fa4af5b3c.mp4?t=1763581814\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you're in for a quick session or a challenge, Neon Strike keeps it simple, vibrant, and fun to retry.</p>",
        "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Quick reflexes. Simple controls. Instant retries!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Neon Strike is a fast-paced action-puzzler where you dash, bounce, and swap colors for survival. Get the color right, you're safe. Get it wrong... instant retry!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3685030/extras/8f7673ca8f2018528ecee6613d5b99f4.poster.avif?t=1763581814\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3685030/extras/8f7673ca8f2018528ecee6613d5b99f4.webm?t=1763581814\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3685030/extras/8f7673ca8f2018528ecee6613d5b99f4.mp4?t=1763581814\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Controls are super simple: one button to move, one to switch colors. Play with one hand on keyboard, mouse, or controller.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You start as a sphere with one color and can absorb more by colliding with other spheres. But you can only store two colors at a time. Grab a third, and the oldest one gets replaced.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To pass anything that isn’t a sphere, your active color must match. Get it wrong and you’ll explode. Watch out for other traps too!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>There’s more than one way to play:</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Tactical Mode</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get to the goal! Bounce, stick, and aim your way through grid-based puzzles using smart angles and color swaps.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3685030/extras/2804ae427aa37b1f0ac02770d88a93bd.poster.avif?t=1763581814\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3685030/extras/2804ae427aa37b1f0ac02770d88a93bd.webm?t=1763581814\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3685030/extras/2804ae427aa37b1f0ac02770d88a93bd.mp4?t=1763581814\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Infinite Mode</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survive as long as you can. Things only get faster, meaner, and more chaotic.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3685030/extras/32833988b5375d3dbc4d4a7fa4af5b3c.poster.avif?t=1763581814\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3685030/extras/32833988b5375d3dbc4d4a7fa4af5b3c.webm?t=1763581814\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3685030/extras/32833988b5375d3dbc4d4a7fa4af5b3c.mp4?t=1763581814\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you're in for a quick session or a challenge, Neon Strike keeps it simple, vibrant, and fun to retry.</p>",
